  "body": "Property Documents can be downloaded here: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/5IX6\r\n\r\nThe owners are relocating from Auckland, and this home must be sold. Properties with amazing views, this much space, and this level of motivation don't hang around.\r\nThe views here are simply stunning, stretching across the Gulf and out to the islands, and they're something you'll never get tired of. Set in a private position, this immaculately presented and spacious family home delivers both impressive outlooks and the room to truly live.\r\nUpstairs is designed for entertaining and relaxed family living, with generous living areas that make the most of those incredible sea views. It's a home that works for big family gatherings, summer get-togethers, and everyday life.\r\nDownstairs is fully self-contained, making it ideal for extended family, teenagers, or guests who want their own space. This is a genuine multi-generational layout with great separation for everyone.\r\nEnjoy the convenience of generous off-street parking for the family cars, with additional space for a boat or camper. Comfortable and well maintained, the home is ready to move into, with scope to personalise and add value over time.\r\nWhangaparaoa Golf Course, Army Bay and Fisherman's Cove are just a short walk away, perfect for swimming, fishing, or coastal walks, while Gulf Harbour Village is only a short drive to cafés, shops, and marina life.\r\nCome and see, you'll want it the moment you walk in. See you at the Open Homes or call us now for a private viewing.",
